Tremor Raw — https://github.com/tremorlabs/tremor
Sources retrieved from the official main branch on 2026-10-21.
The complete upstream licence is in raw/LICENSE (Apache-2.0 and component notices).

raw/components, raw/hooks, raw/utils contain actual upstream component sources.
raw/theme.css contains the upstream src/globals.css animation theme, without
its global body rules or preflight so other roles retain their existing styles.
Local adaptations: explicit .js relative imports for this project's ESM compiler;
monotone interpolation for AreaChart/LineChart; ChartTooltip is exported so the
existing translated labels/formatters can be retained by the data adapters.
Optional index guards support the host's strict compiler settings. File-input
disabled variants use Tailwind 4's disabled:file ordering.
BarChart accepts optional controlled selection, X-axis formatting and minimum
hit-area size to retain the host calculator's existing date/month interactions.
Whole-column controlled highlighting keeps stacked metric segments equally
visible when a calculator month is selected (local adaptation, 2026-10-22).
Optional category-width and bar-width limits keep short calculator time series
compact without padding the data with artificial dates (2026-10-22).
No business calculations or API implementation are imported from Tremor.
The partner visual scope uses upstream Tailwind color tokens directly. Tenant
brandColor is not aliased to Tremor's blue palette or chart colors.
Support Dashboard is the visual reference only; premium template code is not copied.
